WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.012 --> 00:00:04.964
Mole watched the ferrets clean the bedrooms.

2
00:00:04.965 --> 00:00:08.591
Then he marched them to the door.

3
00:00:08.592 --> 00:00:11.749
"Out you go!" he said.

4
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.307
"And don't come back."

5
00:00:15.308 --> 00:00:18.640
He joined his friends in the kitchen.

6
00:00:18.641 --> 00:00:22.813
"We found jelly and cold chicken," said Toad.

7
00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:26.514
"And here's some bread and cheese," said Rat.

8
00:00:26.515 --> 00:00:30.555
They all sat down to supper.

9
00:00:30.556 --> 00:00:35.015
"Did the ferrets sweep under the beds?" asked Badger.

10
00:00:35.016 --> 00:00:37.286
"Yes," said Mole.

11
00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:41.209
"They put clean sheets on too?" asked Badger.

12
00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:44.751
"I watched them myself," said Mole.

13
00:00:44.752 --> 00:00:50.274
"Is there fresh soap and clean towels?" said Badger.

14
00:00:50.275 --> 00:00:54.158
"Everything is perfect!" said Mole.

15
00:00:54.159 --> 00:00:57.922
"Good!" said Badger, smiling.

16
00:00:57.923 --> 00:01:03.180
"It will be nice to sleep indoors on soft beds!"

17
00:01:03.181 --> 00:01:06.728
"The ferrets said they were sorry," said Mole.

18
00:01:06.729 --> 00:01:10.451
"They blame everything on the Chief Weasel.

19
00:01:10.452 --> 00:01:14.137
They say he is a bully and a thief."

20
00:01:14.138 --> 00:01:19.159
"Well, I hope they learned a lesson!" said Badger.

21
00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:23.460
The four friends were tired but happy.

22
00:01:23.461 --> 00:01:27.372
"The dining hall is still a mess," said Rat.

23
00:01:27.373 --> 00:01:30.191
"It will take a week to clean it up."

24
00:01:30.192 --> 00:01:34.003
"Don't worry about it now," said Badger.

25
00:01:34.004 --> 00:01:38.259
"My thanks to all of you," said Toad.

26
00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:41.157
"You saved my home."

27
00:01:41.158 --> 00:01:44.739
Rat and Mole smiled at him.

28
00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:52.254
"Toad," said Badger, "I never saw anyone fight so well!"

29
00:01:52.255 --> 00:01:56.191
Toad smiled proudly.

30
00:01:56.192 --> 00:02:01.631
"I usually say nice things about myself," Toad thought.

31
00:02:01.632 --> 00:02:05.576
"But it's nicer when someone else says them!"

32
00:02:05.577 --> 00:02:14.011
Toad was happy to be home again at Toad Hall.

